  "Google dork: site:target.com intitle:\"index of\"": "Steps:\n\n1. This dork finds pages whose title contains \"index of\" — open directory listings that expose files.\n2. Search:\nsite:target.com intitle:\"index of\"\n3. Open each result to confirm it’s exposed and reachable.\n4. Check whether it requires authentication (often it doesn’t).\n5. Report exposed pages that shouldn’t be publicly indexed.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nPages titled \"index of\" are publicly indexed (open directory listings that expose files), exposing sensitive areas.\n\nSeverity: Medium",
