  "Google dork: site:target.com intext:\"password\"": "Steps:\n\n1. This dork finds pages whose body contains \"password\" — a likely secret leak.\n2. Search:\nsite:target.com intext:\"password\"\n3. Open each hit and look for the actual value near the keyword.\n4. Combine with filetype: (e.g. filetype:log intext:\"password\") to hit config/log leaks.\n5. Report and (carefully) validate any live secret found.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nPages containing the word \"password\" may expose actual credentials/secrets to search engines.\n\nSeverity: High",
