  "Test for HATEOAS link manipulation in responses": "Steps:\n\n1. Exercise the REST behaviour in this check (content negotiation / caching / conditional requests) and Capture the request in Burp Suite (Proxy → HTTP history) and send it to Repeater so you can tamper and replay it.\n2. Manipulate the relevant headers (Accept, If-None-Match, Cache-Control) and observe responses.\n3. Check for cache issues (sensitive data cached/served cross-user) or negotiation that returns unexpected formats.\n4. Test whether responses expose internal links/fields.\n5. Confirm the specific REST weakness described.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nThe REST behaviour (content negotiation/caching/conditional handling) is misconfigured, causing information exposure or cache-related issues.\n\nSeverity: Low–Medium",
