  "Test if API pagination supports forward and backward navigation safely": "Steps:\n\n1. Test the list/filter endpoint and Capture the request in Burp Suite (Proxy → HTTP history) and send it to Repeater so you can tamper and replay it.\n2. Try oversized/negative/zero/missing limit and offset values for DoS/over-retrieval.\n3. Decode and tamper any cursor token for IDOR.\n4. Iterate all pages checking for cross-user data leakage.\n5. Confirm the pagination/filtering weakness in this check.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nThe API’s pagination/filtering lacks bounds or protection, enabling data over-exposure, cursor IDOR, or access-control bypass.\n\nSeverity: Medium",
