  "Check if API versioning is consistent across all endpoints in the same service": "Steps:\n\n1. Review the versioning scheme and Capture the request in Burp Suite (Proxy → HTTP history) and send it to Repeater so you can tamper and replay it.\n2. Enumerate all live versions and compare their security controls (auth, authz, rate limit, validation).\n3. Check that deprecated versions are sunset (warnings/blocked) and consistent across endpoints.\n4. Test manipulating the version selector to reach weaker versions.\n5. Confirm and document the versioning weakness in this check.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nAPI versioning is inconsistent or lets clients reach deprecated/weaker versions, undermining security controls.\n\nSeverity: Medium",
