  "Test if API CORS configuration allows wildcard origin with credentials": "Steps:\n\n1. Send an API request with a foreign Origin and Capture the request in Burp Suite (Proxy → HTTP history) and send it to Repeater so you can tamper and replay it.:\ncurl -sI https://target.com/api/resource -H 'Origin: https://evil.com'\n2. Inspect the response for Access-Control-Allow-Origin reflecting your origin, together with Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true.\n3. Test the specific case: Origin: https://evil.com.\n4. If arbitrary/null origins are allowed with credentials, build a PoC page that fetches the API with credentials:'include' and reads the response.\n5. Also check the preflight (OPTIONS): allowed methods/headers should be minimal.\n6. Confirm cross-origin reading of authenticated data.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nThe API reflects untrusted Origins (or allows null/file/local/suffix matches) with Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true, so a malicious site reads authenticated API responses.\n\nSeverity: High",
  "Check if API dynamically reflects Origin header in Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "Steps:\n\n1. Send an API request with a foreign Origin and Capture the request in Burp Suite (Proxy → HTTP history) and send it to Repeater so you can tamper and replay it.:\ncurl -sI https://target.com/api/resource -H 'Origin: https://evil.com'\n2. Inspect the response for Access-Control-Allow-Origin reflecting your origin, together with Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true.\n3. Test the specific case: Origin: https://evil.com.\n4. If arbitrary/null origins are allowed with credentials, build a PoC page that fetches the API with credentials:'include' and reads the response.\n5. Also check the preflight (OPTIONS): allowed methods/headers should be minimal.\n6. Confirm cross-origin reading of authenticated data.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nThe API reflects untrusted Origins (or allows null/file/local/suffix matches) with Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true, so a malicious site reads authenticated API responses.\n\nSeverity: High",
