  "Test for webhook SMS service target for premium rate abuse": "Steps:\n\n1. Register a webhook pointing to a slow/failing endpoint you control.\n2. Trigger many events and observe the retry behaviour.\n3. Check for exponential backoff and a retry cap — unbounded retries enable amplification/DoS against a third party.\n4. Assess whether an attacker can weaponise retries to flood a victim URL.\n5. Confirm missing backoff/retry limits.\n\nVulnerable When:\n\nWebhook retries lack exponential backoff and a cap, enabling request amplification/DoS toward an attacker-chosen target.\n\nSeverity: Medium",
